41
00:01:47,750 --> 00:01:48,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

42
00:01:59,890 --> 00:02:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My, my arm!</font>

43
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Orochimaru-sama?</font>

44
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take this medicine quickly.</font>

45
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my...</font>

46
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I get back,
I have to clean the room.</font>

47
00:02:30,250 --> 00:02:32,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please make sure to take
your medicine.</font>

48
00:02:33,290 --> 00:02:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need that kind
of lip service.</font>

49
00:02:37,010 --> 00:02:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's medicine that I prescribed.</font>

50
00:02:39,930 --> 00:02:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pain should subside
at least slightly.</font>

51
00:02:42,930 --> 00:02:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pain on this arm
that seems to burn...</font>

52
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought that it causes
this much suffering.</font>

53
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:55,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi... known as Third Hokage.
It's his last curse, after all.</font>

54
00:02:55,230 --> 00:02:56,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough of the talking...</font>

55
00:02:57,110 --> 00:02:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly,
has that individual been found?</font>

56
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... She seems to be at a place
called Tanzaku Town.</font>

57
00:03:05,410 --> 00:03:06,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tanzaku Town...</font>

58
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so...?</font>

59
00:03:12,630 --> 00:03:16,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the opponent is one of the Sannin,
the Legendary Three Ninja.</font>

60
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:19,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't be that simple.</font>

61
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:25,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good medicine tends to taste bitter.</font>

62
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

63
00:03:39,570 --> 00:03:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same one...
But this is the trick?</font>

64
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:47,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the type who was yelled at
at the academy</font>

65
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for not having concentration, right?</font>

66
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:51,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't have anything
to do with me now.</font>

67
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at this paper.</font>

68
00:03:54,670 --> 00:03:55,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh?</font>

69
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've seen it.</font>

70
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine, then.</font>

71
00:03:58,710 --> 00:04:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at it again.</font>

72
00:04:04,930 --> 00:04:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

73
00:04:11,810 --> 00:04:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what is this?</font>

74
00:04:13,390 --> 00:04:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not something that
I need to explain in length,</font>

75
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but when you first looked
at this blank piece of paper,</font>

76
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:22,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you just glanced at
the whole thing, correct?</font>

77
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably.</font>

78
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then where do you look on this one?</font>

79
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most likely the point in the middle?</font>

80
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a human being looks at
just a blank piece of paper,</font>

81
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he doesn't know where to look,
so the eyes wander.</font>

82
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you put even a single point on it,</font>

83
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the mind focuses there...</font>

84
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is concentrating at a single point
and as you focus your mind,</font>

85
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you become spiritually stable and
you are able to extract unexpected power.</font>

86
00:04:58,980 --> 00:05:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

87
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you opened a hole
on the rubber ball,</font>

88
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you must have been
concentrating desperately</font>

89
00:05:05,490 --> 00:05:09,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to fill up the Chakra
in the palm of your hand.</font>

90
00:05:09,530 --> 00:05:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah.</font>

91
00:05:11,450 --> 00:05:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you concentrate,
power emerges.</font>

92
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But without a target,
it is difficult to concentrate.</font>

93
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we have this...</font>

94
00:05:20,380 --> 00:05:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen Naruto, from now on,</font>

95
00:05:22,710 --> 00:05:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you store up the Chakra
you build in your right hand,</font>

96
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:29,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">try to store it up by concentrating
on that mark.</font>

97
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate...</font>

98
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I'll try it!</font>

99
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:42,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Leaf Village Mark
and</font>

100
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:42,110
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Forehead Protector</font>

101
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate!</font>

102
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:05,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. It's not supposed to be like this.</font>

103
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has to break like "pang!".</font>

104
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:14,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate!</font>

105
00:06:31,950 --> 00:06:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hello... I'd like to make a little inquiry.</font>

106
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it.</font>

107
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate.</font>

108
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate!</font>

109
00:07:41,230 --> 00:07:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good.</font>

110
00:07:53,990 --> 00:07:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. What does it mean
to concentrate?!</font>

111
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:17,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you, Sarutobi!</font>

112
00:08:41,370 --> 00:08:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right then...</font>

113
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going again to gather
some information.</font>

114
00:08:45,170 --> 00:08:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? But you just came.</font>

115
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have any time to waste.</font>

116
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey...!</font>

117
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there going to be even
a little soulful game of catch</font>

118
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">between the master and pupil?</font>

119
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You scoundrel.</font>

120
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:08,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strike!</font>

121
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:11,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, the game of catch is over.</font>

122
00:09:13,490 --> 00:09:15,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later.</font>

123
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... I'll forget about that Pervy Sage
and work hard by myself.</font>

124
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:30,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the only way, Naruto...</font>

125
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have to do this training alone.</font>

126
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have the ability to approach
the Fourth Hokage's level...</font>

127
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grasp it by yourself!</font>

128
00:09:41,010 --> 00:09:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... Never seen her.</font>

129
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case...</font>

130
00:09:46,810 --> 00:09:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to bother you.</font>

131
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know the person.</font>

132
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As well as where she is right now.</font>

133
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:57,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll buy you a drink.</font>

134
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need.
I was able to win a tidy sum...</font>

135
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to that lady.</font>

136
00:10:05,370 --> 00:10:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... you are indeed
the Legendary Sitting Duck.</font>

137
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She lost again, huh.</font>

138
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:14,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Her losses started to pile up...</font>

139
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So she was talking about
changing her location.</font>

140
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where to?</font>

141
00:10:20,390 --> 00:10:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of the Sannin, Tsunade-sama,
is staying at Tanzaku Town over there.</font>

142
00:10:27,020 --> 00:10:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then this arm can finally...</font>

143
00:10:29,810 --> 00:10:31,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's good medicine,</font>

144
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:34,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you won't get away with just
a bitter taste with that person.</font>

145
00:10:34,980 --> 00:10:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's fine.</font>

146
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seven, seven, seven...</font>

147
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seven, seven, seven...</font>

148
00:10:52,210 --> 00:10:55,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seven, seven, seven...</font>

149
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it comes!</font>

150
00:11:00,010 --> 00:11:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Congratulations to the customer!</font>

151
00:11:01,970 --> 00:11:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fever has started
on machine number 44.</font>

152
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, please keep on getting it out
like a flood.</font>

153
00:11:08,180 --> 00:11:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, a rare thing does happen
once in a while.</font>

154
00:11:12,770 --> 00:11:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A 3-7 for me?</font>

155
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:21,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh wow, lady.</font>

156
00:11:21,950 --> 00:11:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, what a great work.</font>

157
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wish I could be favored
by good fortune too.</font>

158
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh, here it comes again!
— Here it comes again!</font>

159
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay... it's "fever" again!</font>

160
00:11:36,460 --> 00:11:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person like me pulls
a big hit like this...</font>

161
00:11:40,590 --> 00:11:42,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a bad premonition.</font>

162
00:11:44,430 --> 00:11:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also have some knowledge
regarding Tsunade-sama...</font>

163
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did use to be part of
the Medical Corps, after all.</font>

164
00:11:52,190 --> 00:11:55,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She was the first person to propose
what is now an accepted practice</font>

165
00:11:55,860 --> 00:12:00,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of assigning one medical specialist
to a small squad of four.</font>

166
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This was a very revolutionary idea...</font>

167
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A small combat unit that doesn't
even have emergency medical skills,</font>

168
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:12,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what would happen to them in a battlefield
is clearer than seeing fire.</font>

169
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:17,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Countless experiences in war</font>

170
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:21,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">simply became knowledge
to equip themselves with.</font>

171
00:12:22,130 --> 00:12:26,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many who were sacrificed
led to the creation of that style.</font>

172
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:29,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person understands the nature
of things for the first time</font>

173
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after losing them.</font>

174
00:12:33,190 --> 00:12:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the thing created by
one of the legendary Sannin,</font>

175
00:12:39,070 --> 00:12:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who is known as the medical specialist</font>

176
00:12:43,150 --> 00:12:45,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is that sacrifice.</font>

177
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:51,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not working...</font>

178
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got to concentrate even more.</font>

179
00:12:58,590 --> 00:13:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate, concentrate.</font>

180
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate, concentrate.</font>

181
00:13:03,970 --> 00:13:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate!</font>

182
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate...</font>

183
00:13:18,650 --> 00:13:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate on one point.</font>

184
00:13:29,620 --> 00:13:30,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strike!</font>

185
00:13:38,210 --> 00:13:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strike!</font>

186
00:13:42,710 --> 00:13:45,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That stupid perv's face floats up
in my head</font>

187
00:13:45,090 --> 00:13:46,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I can't even concentrate.</font>

188
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh boy...</font>

189
00:13:51,350 --> 00:13:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some gal somewhere is talking
about me again.</font>

190
00:13:55,560 --> 00:14:00,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Pinball Games"</b></font>

191
00:13:57,600 --> 00:14:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait for me, Tsunade-sama!</font>

192
00:14:00,690 --> 00:14:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

193
00:14:02,110 --> 00:14:05,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your winning this much is like a miracle...</font>

194
00:14:05,860 --> 00:14:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you don't look pleased at all.</font>

195
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This town.</font>

196
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

197
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get a bad premonition.</font>

198
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to hurry up and leave.</font>

199
00:14:15,450 --> 00:14:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this is a tourist resort...</font>

200
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should take our time and
go see the famous castle and all.</font>

201
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we're going to hurry up
and see it so we can leave.</font>

202
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... Tsunade-sama!</font>

203
00:14:27,970 --> 00:14:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama!</font>

204
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:32,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get this business over with.</font>

205
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we have to use
a slightly rough method.</font>

206
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got to do it.</font>

207
00:14:46,690 --> 00:14:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

208
00:14:47,950 --> 00:14:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch... It hurts so much,
I can't even build up my Chakra...</font>

209
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might be reaching his limit soon.</font>

210
00:15:06,050 --> 00:15:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a bit... just a bit more rest.</font>

211
00:15:48,710 --> 00:15:49,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

212
00:15:50,340 --> 00:15:52,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys, we're in class right now.</font>

213
00:15:53,760 --> 00:15:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... fools!</font>

214
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys have no concentration at all...!</font>

215
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:08,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not the way to
become fine Ninja.</font>

216
00:16:09,150 --> 00:16:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can we stay still at a table,
right, Akamaru?</font>

217
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hungry.</font>

218
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:20,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, if it's a scolding,
do it quickly.</font>

219
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?! You, you guys...</font>

220
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now, we will have
an after-school lesson</font>

221
00:16:27,090 --> 00:16:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to teach you guys more concentration!</font>

222
00:16:29,510 --> 00:16:31,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

223
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:37,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

224
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:40,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are going to do from now</font>

225
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:42,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what the predecessors of
the Leaf Village</font>

226
00:16:42,140 --> 00:16:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">used to perform every day
as a concentration method!</font>

227
00:16:45,690 --> 00:16:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is training to build up Chakra</font>

228
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:51,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by concentrating your entire energy
on the leaf on your forehead.</font>

229
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:54,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an ancient way of learning</font>

230
00:16:54,450 --> 00:16:56,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how not to become distracted
from anything else</font>

231
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:57,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by concentrating on a single point,
the leaf.</font>

232
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one who hones his concentration
is truly a great Ninja...</font>

233
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:07,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the origin of the Leaf Symbol
on the headband.</font>

234
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sounds like a lie.</font>

235
00:17:09,090 --> 00:17:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you making that story up
to force us to try harder?</font>

236
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not making this up!
It's a true story.</font>

237
00:17:15,220 --> 00:17:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyhow, can you really become
a great Ninja</font>

238
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by just polishing your concentration?</font>

239
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:22,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate,
a great Ninja is a guy who's strong.</font>

240
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you have a point.</font>

241
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This stuff...</font>

242
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bye, bye Sensei!</font>

243
00:17:30,610 --> 00:17:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, you guys wait a minute.</font>

244
00:17:32,650 --> 00:17:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— We won't wait!
— We don't have time for that!</font>

245
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You misfits!</font>

246
00:17:43,330 --> 00:17:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the same thing.</font>

247
00:17:47,460 --> 00:17:51,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should have paid more attention
to what Iruka-sensei was saying...</font>

248
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so stupid.</font>

249
00:17:57,720 --> 00:18:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But nothing will start
if I just keep on regretting.</font>

250
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I'm going to master this!</font>

251
00:18:17,150 --> 00:18:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate, concentrate...</font>

252
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate!</font>

253
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:29,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow! Tanzaku Castle sure does have
a commanding presence!</font>

254
00:18:30,210 --> 00:18:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's worth being designated
as the cultural heritage.</font>

255
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't dally...</font>

256
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to hurry up
and leave this town.</font>

257
00:18:39,130 --> 00:18:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, please look more carefully...</font>

258
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It costs nothing to view.</font>

259
00:18:48,060 --> 00:18:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama?</font>

260
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:54,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this chill?</font>

261
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

262
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a kid...</font>

263
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:13,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raising the density in Chakra
to the point that it burns the palm.</font>

264
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He never ceases to amaze me.</font>

265
00:20:23,660 --> 00:20:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It broke.</font>

266
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:28,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good! The second step seems
to be complete.</font>

267
00:20:28,580 --> 00:20:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry... The third step.</font>

268
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That will come later.</font>

269
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll now go meet Tsunade.</font>

270
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

271
00:20:53,690 --> 00:20:54,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru.</font>

272
00:21:02,780 --> 00:21:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found you.</font>

273
00:21:09,460 --> 00:21:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

274
00:21:09,460 --> 00:21:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

275
00:21:14,420 --> 00:21:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

276
00:21:14,420 --> 00:21:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

277
00:21:19,470 --> 00:21:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

278
00:21:19,470 --> 00:21:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

279
00:21:27,520 --> 00:21:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

280
00:21:27,520 --> 00:21:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

281
00:21:33,330 --> 00:21:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

282
00:21:33,330 --> 00:21:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

283
00:21:36,730 --> 00:21:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

284
00:21:36,730 --> 00:21:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

285
00:21:41,870 --> 00:21:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

286
00:21:41,870 --> 00:21:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

287
00:21:47,710 --> 00:21:52,480
